<p>Teleport to the target and attack with your melee weapons for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100%</acronym> damage.  Then teleport next to a second random enemy, attacking for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100%</acronym> damage.</p><p>Blink Blade can hit the same target multiple times.</p>